# Controller briefs quote unified diffs, whose blank context lines are a single space.
.claude/controller/briefs/*.md -whitespace
# Planner kits hold unified diffs and patches, whose context lines may be a single space.
.claude/controller/scratch/** -whitespace
# The build controller's state and skill (handover, briefs, reviews, kits). GitHub collapses generated files in
# pull request diffs, so the owner's review of a promotion PR shows the task's product changes first.
.claude/** linguist-generated=true
